      "desc:8": "§6Machine type: §aVoid Miner§r\n\n\" Do you sell them ? \"\n\" I'm afraid not. \"\n\" But, maybe we could make a deal ? \"\nTo the depths, to gather for you the deepest riches of the planet.\nEach run produces 24 types of ore, 131072 of each type,\nand takes 6.4s, 2,013,265,920 EU/t (MAX).\nThe mining access portion of the structure needs to extend at least to a height of 20 below.\nPut Astral Array Fabricator into controller slot then machine can further increase ore production.\nThere is a serious bug in the blueprint automatic construction function of borosilicate glass,\nwhich may cause the save file to crash and become inaccessible.\nIn case of emergency, you can install ZeroPointBugFix mod for temporary fix.\nJoining the wireless EU network when without installing an energy hatch.\n\n[note]Hatches[/note]: Output Bus, Energy Hatch\n[note]Structure[/note]: Tiered glass (limits the energy hatch tier); Naquadah Alloy Frame Boxes; Space Elevator casings; the casings in the optional task.\nUse a Hologram Projector (or the NEI structure preview) to see and auto-build the structure.\n\n[note]Controller recipe[/note]: Assembly Line, UIV\nResearch item: Infinity tool Head Drill\n - 64x S Block Casings SE\n - 18x UEV\n - 18x Space Warper\n - 64x Energised Tesseract\n - 64x Electric Motor UEV\n - 48x Field Generator UEV\n - 64x Sensor UEV\n - 64x UIV Circuit\n - 64x High Energy Flow Circuit\n - 64x EM Power\n - 64x Superconductor UEV 16x Wire\n - 147,456 L Solder plasma\n - 147,456 L Molten Quantium\n - 2,048,000 L UU Matter",
